# Chapter 18 checkpoint. Start InventoryService, then the app:
#   dotnet run --project InventoryService
#   dotnet run --project AdventureWorks
# (two terminals, both from this folder; in Visual Studio, set
# both as startup projects). Each "Expect" line is the status
# you should see. The same three requests work against the
# container on http://localhost:8080 (README).
@host = https://localhost:7001

###
# The process answers. Expect 200
GET {{host}}/health/live

###
# The database and the warehouse answer. Expect 200
GET {{host}}/health/ready

###
# The public catalog. Expect 200 with "sku": "HLM-1001"
GET {{host}}/api/catalog
